    "IMPORTANT — every time, day and instructor below is a placeholder.",
    "This project has no source of Dotfit's actual batch timings or",
    "instructor names, so nothing here is real. The times are round,",
    "generic numbers chosen only to show the page's layout; 'Instructor:",
    "[Instructor Name]' is meant to stay bracketed until a real name goes",
    "in. The page itself carries a visible notice saying this is a sample",
    "schedule for the same reason — don't remove that notice until the",
    "real data replaces it.",
    "",
    "day codes: mon tue wed thu fri sat sun",
    "time_of_day: morning | evening — used by the Morning/Evening filter.",
    "level is a general description of the class itself (who it suits),",
